        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "For the shows you follow on Trakt. It tells you once there's a Real-Debrid source, with buttons to watch here, on the TV or download it. From 11 PM to 8 AM it waits until morning; several on the same day arrive together."
